==Event Information==
The colorful characters from the hit series {{Color|#6554C0|'''Rurouni Kenshin'''}} join The Battle Cats for a limited-time collab!<br>
{{Color|#BF2600|'''On from August 5, 2024 (11:00AM) until August 19, 2024 (10:59AM)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF991F|'''・Rurouni Kenshin limited collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
Recruit the stars of the Rurouni Kenshin series like {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Kenshin Himura'''}} and {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Sanosuke Sagara'''}}, only available from this Capsule set for a limited time!

Pick up heroes like:<br>
[[Kenshin Himura (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF5630|'''Kenshi Himura (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Gentle, wandering swordsman who carries a sakabato blade! Area attacks deal Massive damage to Traitless and Aku!<br>
[[Sanosuke Sagara (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#36B37E|'''Sanosuke Sagara (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Known in the underworld as a fighter for hire! Tough vs. Zombies, and Omnistrikes sometimes deals Critical damage!<br>
[[Aoshi Shinomori (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Aoshi Shinomori (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Headed the Oniwaban Group even as a young prodigy! Strong against Floating and Angels, with Long-range area attacks that Freeze enemies!<br>
[[Hajime Saito (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#6554C0|'''Hajime Saito (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Once defended Kyoto as the Shinsengumi's Third Unit captain! Omnistrikes deal Massive damage to Red and Aku and Pierces Aku Shields!<br>
[[Li'l Kaoru (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF991F|'''Li'l Kaoru (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Sometimes Weakens Floating enemies with Area attacks!<br>
[[Li'l Yahiko (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00B8D9|'''Li'l Yahiko (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks deal Massive damage to Floating and Angels!

※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the Rurouni Kenshin collab units from the Rurouni Kenshin capsule set. <br>
※ Rurouni Kenshin units cannot be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the Rurouni Kenshin capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※If Rurouni Kenshin Collab Capsules do not appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.

{{Color|#FF991F|'''● Collab Stages appear in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
The strongest heroes of Rurouni Kenshin issue a challenge to your Cats in a series of special collab stages appearing in The Battle Cats' Legend Stages!

{{Color|#FF991F|'''・Special Map: Rurouni Kenshin'''}}<br>
Clear this map for a small chance to collect the collab-limited unit [[Kenshin Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Kenshin Cat'''}}]] a drop reward! Later stages in this map grant a higher chance to collect {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Kenshin Cat'''}} as a drop reward. (Using a Treasure Radar provides a 100% chance to pick up the reward!)

※ Activate Kenshin Cat by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade Menu!

{{Color|#FF991F|'''・Special Map: Kenshin Himura, Battosai'''}}<br>
Battle the most feared Isshin warrior, Kenshin, and his swift sword strikes in this special collab stage!<br>
Timed Score rewards are availbale for each stage including {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Rare Tickets'''}} and {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''other useful items'''}}!

※Check the bottom-left of the Stage Select screen to confirm each reward for each stage.<br>
{{Color|#FF991F|'''・Special Map: Sanosuke Sagara, Fighter for Hire'''}}<br>
Sanosuke Sagara and his massive zanbatou arrive, and they're ready for a fight!<br>
Timed Score rewards are available for each stage including {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Rare Tickets'''}} and {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Cat Tickets'''}}!

※Check the bottom-left of the Stage Select screen to confirm each reward for each stage.<br>
※ After clearing a stage from this map, there will be a brief cooldown period before further stages in the map can be challenged.<br>
※ You may choose to spend a Catamin A to skip the cooldown and challenge other stages in the map immediately.

{{Color|#FF991F|'''・Special Map: Aoshi Shinomori Strikes!'''}}<br>
Challenge this new Gauntlet stage starting {{Color|#BF2600|'''August 7, 2024 (11:00AM)'''}}! Battle Aoshi Shimomori and his relentless kaiten kenbu strikes! Each stage has its own drop reward to collect!

※ After clearing a stage from this map, there will be a brief cooldown period before the next gauntlet stage can be accessed.<br>
※ You may choose to spend a Catamin A to skip the cooldown and challenge the next Gauntlet stage immediately.

{{Color|#FF991F|'''・Special Map: A Wolf Baring Fangs'''}}<br>
{{Color|#BF2600|'''Starting August 12, 2024 (11:00AM),'''}} new tough stages appear where you can battle Hajime Saito and challenge his ideology of "Swift Death to Evil"!<br>
Clear thie stage to earn {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Rare Tickets'''}}, {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Cat Tickets'''}}, and {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Legend Catseyes'''}}!

{{Color|#FF991F|'''●"The Swords of Meiji" appears in the Arena of Honor'''}}<br>
Get your strongest Cat Army ready to prove yourself in a special Rurouni Kenshin Dojo Ranking Event! Select {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''"The Swords of Meiji"'''}} at the Catclaw Dojo and aim for the top score as you face off against the powerful swordsmen of this limited collab event!<br>
Climb to the highest tiers of power as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players? Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn a special prize when your final high score determines your skill tier.<br>
Tap the Rewards List button to see what you might win as you climb the rankings!

※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Thanks for your patience!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor.<br>
※ Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If the Arena of Honor does not appear even if the conditions are met, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF991F|'''・Limited Gamatoto Expedition Areas!'''}}<br>
Rurouni Kenshin-themed Gamatoto area {{Color|#0747A6|'''Kamiya Dojo'''}} will be available only during this collaboration event!<br>
Don't miss out on bonus rewards - send your Gamatoto gang to these special stages before they disappear!

{{Color|#FF991F|'''● Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn delightful bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only Rurouni Kenshin events!

※Rurouni Kenshin Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until August 19, 2024 at 10:59am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!

{{Color|#FF991F|'''● Login each day for stamp rewards and a limited edition Cat Unit!'''}}<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and unlock awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!! Plus, your fifth Login Stamp will unlock the {{Color|#0747A6|'''Special Collab Unit "'''}}[[Kaoru Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#0747A6|'''Li'l Kaoru'''}}]]{{Color|#0747A6|'''"'''}}.<br>
Don't forget to login or you'll miss out!

※ Once received, you can unlock "Li'l Kaoru" by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※ Up to 14 Login Stamps are available from this event.

